source: crates/rumps-query/tests/scripts.rs
description: "; Default bodies may call required methods from the same class.\n\nvariant Cell = Cell(Int)\n\n#(required: f)\nclass Optional C {\n  fun f(x: C) -> Int\n  fun g(x: C) -> Int\n\n  #(default)\n  fun g(x) {\n    Optional:f(x) + 1\n  }\n}\n\nclass Optional for Cell {\n  fun f(x: Cell) -> Int {\n    match x {\n      Cell.Cell(n) => { n }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nfun main() {\n  write Optional:g(Cell.Cell(3))\n}\n"
---
